<title>SOUTH KOREA: TABLE-Mando Machinery H1 net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Mando Machinery H1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>	 (in billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (won)				   3,587 vs 1,764</p>
<p>    Net					   17.44 vs 14.11</p>
<p>    Profit before tax			 21.15 vs 16.40</p>
<p>    Turnover				   729.27 vs 646.07</p>
<p>Note - Mando Machinery Co Ltd, a unit of the Halla Group, is South Korea's largest producer of vehicle components. The figures were released by the Korea Listed Companies Association. -- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5645</p>
</text>
